                                "example_id": "20b4d41d-11ab-4437-9936-d0d82c98e7d6",
                                "sense_id": "c9204aab-9737-3730-bed8-55087997aac7",
                                "text": "Ich habe Baader und Ensslin gesagt: Lasst diese Jugendlichen in Ruhe. Daraufhin zückte Baader seine Mao-Bibel und sagte: »Sie sind die Speerspitze des revolutionären Proletariats.«",
                                "translation": "I told Baader and Ensslin to leave these youths alone. Thereupon Baader pulled out his Little Red Book and said: “They are the spearhead of the revolutionary proletariat.”",
                                "english": "I told Baader and Ensslin to leave these youths alone. Thereupon Baader pulled out his Little Red Book and said: “They are the spearhead of the revolutionary proletariat.”"
                            }
                        ]
